.TH "snakepit snapshot" 1  "snakepit snapshot " 
.SH NAME
snakepit snapshot \- 📸 Manage package snapshots
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnakepit snapshot\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
📸 Manage package snapshots
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
snakepit snapshot\-list(1)
📋 List all snapshots
.TP
snakepit snapshot\-restore(1)
⏪ Restore a snapshot
.TP
snakepit snapshot\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
